WEBVTT

00:03:28.231 --> 00:03:30.537
Unfortunately, you didn't do very well.

00:03:30.561 --> 00:03:32.634
(Laughter)

00:03:32.658 --> 00:03:35.714
The quantum computer won
almost every game.

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:39.881
It lost a few only because
of operational errors in the computer.

00:03:39.905 --> 00:03:41.867
(Laughter)

00:03:41.891 --> 00:03:45.192
So how did it achieve
this amazing winning streak?

00:03:46.224 --> 00:03:48.717
It seems like magic or cheating,

00:03:48.741 --> 00:03:51.119
but actually, it's just
quantum physics in action.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.356
Here's how it works.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:58.832
A regular computer simulates
heads or tails of a coin as a bit,

00:03:58.856 --> 00:04:00.511
a zero or a one,